  "/": { "kind": "markdown", "meta": { "title": "Welcome", "description": "Get started with PreactPress in minutes" }, "html": '<h1 id="welcome" class="pp-heading">Welcome<a class="pp-heading-anchor" href="#welcome" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h1>\n<p>This site is generated with <strong>PreactPress</strong> — a Vite and Preact static site generator for documentation, blogs, and marketing pages.</p>\n<h2 id="quick-start" class="pp-heading">Quick start<a class="pp-heading-anchor" href="#quick-start" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h2>\n<p>From this folder:</p>\n<pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark" style="background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span style="color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0">pnpm</span><span style="color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF"> install</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0">pnpm</span><span style="color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF"> run</span><span style="color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF"> dev</span></span></code></pre><p>Open <strong><a href="http://localhost:5173" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">http://localhost:5173</a></strong>. Edit Markdown files, adjust <code>.preactpress/config.ts</code>, and the dev server hot-reloads your changes.</p>\n<h2 id="what-to-read-next" class="pp-heading">What to read next<a class="pp-heading-anchor" href="#what-to-read-next" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Page</th>\n<th>Why</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href="/guide/what-is-preactpress">What is PreactPress?</a></td>\n<td>Understand the static-site generator and when to use it</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href="/guide/getting-started">Getting Started</a></td>\n<td>Install PreactPress and learn the starter structure</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href="/guide/routing">Routing</a></td>\n<td>See how Markdown and MDX files become URLs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href="/guide/deploy">Deploy</a></td>\n<td>Build and publish the generated static files</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href="/guide/first-five-minutes">Your first 5 minutes</a></td>\n<td>Change the title, add a page, wire up navigation</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href="/about">About</a></td>\n<td>Example page created in the tutorial</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href="/markdown-examples">Markdown examples</a></td>\n<td>Code blocks, tables, links, and quotes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href="/interactive">Interactive MDX</a></td>\n<td>Preact components inside Markdown</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id="what-you-get" class="pp-heading">What you get<a class="pp-heading-anchor" href="#what-you-get" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Feature</th>\n<th>Included</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Static HTML build</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Client navigation</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Markdown frontmatter</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MDX with Preact components</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Code highlighting</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sidebar search</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The default theme is intentionally small. Replace it with your own Preact layout when your site grows — see the package README for <code>theme</code> configuration.</p>\n</blockquote>\n', "title": "Welcome", "description": "Get started with PreactPress in minutes", "tags": [], "pageType": "website", "headings": [{ "id": "quick-start", "text": "Quick start", "level": 2 }, { "id": "what-to-read-next", "text": "What to read next", "level": 2 }, { "id": "what-you-get", "text": "What you get", "level": 2 }], "relativePath": "index.md", "lastUpdated": "2026-05-29T08:37:00.831Z" },
  "/markdown-examples": { "kind": "markdown", "meta": { "title": "Markdown examples", "description": "Common authoring snippets", "tags": ["markdown"] }, "html": '<h2 id="code" class="pp-heading">Code<a class="pp-heading-anchor" href="#code" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h2>\n<pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark" style="background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span style="color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583">export</span><span style="color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583"> function</span><span style="color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0"> greet</span><span style="color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8">(</span><span style="color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70">name</span><span style="color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583">:</span><span style="color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF"> string</span><span style="color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8">) {</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583">  return</span><span style="color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF"> `Hello, ${</span><span style="color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8">name</span><span style="color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF">}!`</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8">}</span></span></code></pre><p>Inline code like <code>themeConfig.outline</code> uses the same theme tokens as code blocks.</p>\n<h2 id="links" class="pp-heading">Links<a class="pp-heading-anchor" href="#links" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h2>\n<p><a href="/">Home</a> · <a href="https://preactjs.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">External link</a></p>\n<h2 id="tables" class="pp-heading">Tables<a class="pp-heading-anchor" href="#tables" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Syntax</th>\n<th>Result</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code># Title</code></td>\n<td>Heading</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>---</code> frontmatter</td>\n<td>Page metadata</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id="quotes" class="pp-heading">Quotes<a class="pp-heading-anchor" href="#quotes" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Use blockquotes for callouts, notes, or short contextual hints.</p>\n</blockquote>\n', "title": "Markdown examples", "description": "Common authoring snippets", "tags": ["markdown"], "pageType": "website", "headings": [{ "id": "code", "text": "Code", "level": 2 }, { "id": "links", "text": "Links", "level": 2 }, { "id": "tables", "text": "Tables", "level": 2 }, { "id": "quotes", "text": "Quotes", "level": 2 }], "relativePath": "markdown-examples.md", "lastUpdated": "2026-05-14T23:45:53.051Z" },
